@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include theme.puml
hide circle
class User <<model>> {
  id : int
  role : string
}
class ServiceOrder <<model>> {
  id : ULID
  ticket_number : string
  --
  +inventoryMovements() : HasMany
  +financialTransactions() : HasMany
}
class InventoryItem <<model>> {
  id : int
  sku : string
  name : string
  quantity_on_hand : int
  reorder_level : int
  unit_cost : int
  --
  +movements() : HasMany
}
class InventoryMovement <<model>> {
  id : int
  type : string
  quantity : int
  balance_after : int
  occurred_at : datetime
  --
  +item() : BelongsTo
  +order() : BelongsTo
  +actor() : BelongsTo
}
class FinancialTransaction <<model>> {
  id : int
  type : string
  amount : int
  payment_method : string
  status : string
  verified_at : datetime?
  --
  +order() : BelongsTo
  +actor() : BelongsTo
  +verifier() : BelongsTo
}
InventoryItem "1" -- "0..*" InventoryMovement : mutasi
ServiceOrder "0..1" -- "0..*" InventoryMovement : pemakaian terkait tiket
ServiceOrder "0..1" -- "0..*" FinancialTransaction : transaksi terkait tiket
User "0..1" -- "0..*" InventoryMovement : actor
User "0..1" -- "0..*" FinancialTransaction : actor
note bottom of FinancialTransaction
  Asosiasi verifier juga ke User:
  0..1 verifier per transaksi; User memverifikasi 0..* transaksi.
  Transaksi dibuat pending; operator memverifikasi/menolak.
  Nominal disimpan sebagai integer rupiah.
end note
note bottom of InventoryMovement
  stock_in / stock_out.
  Mutasi dan saldo barang diperbarui atomik.
  Pengeluaran melebihi stok ditolak.
end note
@enduml
